WEBVTT

00:02:00.110 --> 00:02:04.110
Everyone's House

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:10.470
Shingo, how is it?

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:12.930
A little longer.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:16.240
Alright, done!

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:17.780
Chako, take care of it!

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.020
Here I go...

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:19.940
There!

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:22.230
Nice!

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:23.410
Darn straight!

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:25.750
I have enough control to thread a needle!

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:30.700
How is it, Menori?

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:32.200
I'll be done soon.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.200
There's just a little more over here as well.

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:36.570
It's become mostly house-like.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:38.560
Let's keep it up.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.280
Hey, over here!

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:43.620
Stop lollygagging!

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:46.530
Hey, hurry it up!

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:48.010
Howard!

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:48.790
Hey!

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:52.040
It's coming along nicely!

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:53.500
Where did you go?

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:56.580
Weren't you supposed to be fishing with Kaoru?

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.380
Kaoru said to leave it to him,
so we stopped by the shuttle.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:01.940
The shuttle?

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.110
Bell! Hurry it up!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:10.580
Bell!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:12.030
It's a seat from the shuttle.

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:14.330
What do you plan to do with that?

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.000
I'm going to put it in the living room.

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:18.250
I'm going to use it as a lounge chair.

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:20.580
Then you should carry it yourself!

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:23.160
You think I can carry something heavy like that?

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:26.140
Got that? It's my lounge chair.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.660
Get my permission before sitting in it!

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:30.960
Hurry and carry it up.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:53.260
I'm done.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.120
Me too.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:56.710
Then I guess the girls' room is finished.

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:58.900
Wrong, on the other side!

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:02.560
Hey, hurry it up!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.310
Why are you making Bell do it by himself?

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.360
Howard, why don't you help him out?

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:13.680
It's impossible. I can't move it with my strength.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.510
But it's your chair!

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:17.070
It's okay.

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:18.630
I'll be done soon.

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:23.990
Alright, it's finished!

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.900
Everyone, gather around for a bit.

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:28.470
What's going to happen?

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:30.760
Well, see for yourselves.

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:33.160
There!

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:40.840
Alright! It's okay!

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:54.930
Alright!

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:09.440
Amazing!

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.830
A water-drawing device.

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:14.560
You bet! Now we won't
have to go down there every time.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.560
That looks like fun!

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:21.930
Let me try it too!

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.190
Don't break it.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:28.380
This is great!

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:35.330
A water-drawing device, a living room...

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:36.890
...the boys' room...

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:38.090
...the girls' room...

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:40.080
...a kitchen, a washroom...

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.340
...and a laundry.

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:45.160
For the time being, I guess we're finished.

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:47.350
All that's left is a door.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:50.540
After all, you have to have
a door on the entrance to a house.

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:51.680
Yeah, he's right.

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:53.930
Can we make a shower stall?

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:54.910
Shower?

00:05:55.600 --> 00:06:00.480
If we have a shower stall, we won't have to take cold baths in a corner of the lake like we have.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.120
That has been a bother.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.840
A shower stall, huh?

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:06.660
Sounds great! Let's make it!

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:10.450
We won't have to send everyone else
away while we're bathing anymore, either.

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:11.990
Chako, it is feasible?

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.050
The problem's the tank.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.730
We'd need a big one.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:18.780
A tank?

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:36.570
Menori, how about this?

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:40.090
It's very thin. Can't you find a fatter one?

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:41.410
Really?

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:44.580
I'll go look again.

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:53.630
If I'd known about this,
I wouldn't have said to make a shower.

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:57.740
Well, you did say it. Pull your side properly!

00:06:57.740 --> 00:06:58.640
Fine, fine!

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:02.350
Stop that!

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:09.570
It's definitely this.

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:27.290
We've taken care of all of them.

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:29.670
It should be okay now.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:31.000
Let's go.

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:48.790
That surprised me.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.710
This time it should be fine.

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:51.720
Sorry.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:53.930
There was one left in a place like this.

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:56.580
Bell, it's not your fault.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:58.690
I didn't realize it, after all.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:00.890
No, it was my carelessness.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.540
I think it'd be better if you
were more confident in yourself.

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:09.080
I've been thinking of saying it for a while...

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:12.570
...but Bell, you're a lot more reliable than you think.

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:15.630
How much have we all relied on you?

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:18.510
Even now, I'm safe thanks to you, Bell.

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:20.290
Thank you.

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.310
Luna...

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:26.010
Well, let's grab that and go home.

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.330
I'm exhausted.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:36.810
It'd be nice if there was a bigger hole in the hose.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:38.610
Can't help it.

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:39.930
Luna's sure late.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.660
Bell's with her. Don't worry.

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:43.540
But...

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.510
Hey! Everyone!

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:47.090
We brought it back!

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:53.390
Luna! You were okay!

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.240
The logging seems to have gone well.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:57.760
Your arm!

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:01.410
It's just a scrape! Bell saved me again.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.790
Luna, we'll definitely be able to use this!

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:07.490
That's a relief. We went through
a lot of trouble to get it.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:13.320
It doesn't seem like he caught any fish.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:18.680
Kaoru...

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:19.980
Food!

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:22.620
Ouch!

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:26.760
Here.

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:31.960
Stop sighing incessantly.

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:35.540
How hard do you think I worked for the shower?

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:37.470
You think just this is enough?

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:39.760
You do a little work, and you start this right away.

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:40.900
What did you say?

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:42.590
Some days the fish don't bite.

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:45.700
Maybe it's his skills that are lacking.

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:50.630
If I'd been doing it, right about now I'd be stuffed full.

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:53.200
Where are you going?

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.260
I don't need any.

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:56.440
Kaoru!

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:57.660
In that case...

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:58.880
...this is extra, right?

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:00.290
That's Kaoru's share.

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.070
You have a complaint?

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:07.210
Sorry I'm the only one who gets two.

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.400
And with that, down the hatch!

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.060
Now there's a winning personality.

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:38.560
Bell, you're a lot more reliable than you think.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:42.660
I think it'd be better if you
were more confident in yourself.

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:05.800
What are you doing down here?

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:08.610
Oh, nothing...

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:15.630
Can I sit here?

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:28.690
When we sit like this,
I remember the first time we made fire.

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:35.140
Your hands were covered in cuts,
and you were still giving everything you had...

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:37.620
Are you okay? You're sweating a lot!

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:41.280
Ever since we came to this planet,
a lot has happened, hasn't it?

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:44.730
The Giant Sea Snake...

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:47.070
...the man-eating plant...

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:50.130
...but Bell, you've always been there to save us.

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:52.710
Everyone's healthy and happy
because you're here, Bell.

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:58.640
Well, I'm going to sleep. Good night.

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:00.180
Good night.

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:42.420
Kaoru, where are you going?

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:45.330
I'm going fishing.

00:12:45.550 --> 00:12:46.110
But...

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:47.760
It's already bright out. I'll be fine.

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:08.930
Kaoru, I'll help.

00:13:09.590 --> 00:13:10.530
I can do it by myself.

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:13.080
You have the shower stall to build, right?

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:15.830
Actually, I have a favour to ask.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:19.960
--Bell! Kaoru!
--Kaoru!

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:21.740
--Bell!
--Kaoru!

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:23.580
How did it go?

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:25.210
They weren't in the washroom either.

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:27.400
They weren't at the bathing area either.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.430
What happened to them?

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:33.120
Since it's those two, I think they'll be fine, but...

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.090
Bell!

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:48.400
Kaoru wasn't with you?

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:50.390
Don't worry about Kaoru.

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:53.330
Maybe we can use this in the shower.

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:54.380
Let's see...

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.130
This is like bamboo, right?

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:57.680
It's perfect for the hose!

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:00.640
This'll hang down, and we'll punch holes in it.

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:11.220
Howard, wake up! How long do you plan to sleep?

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.520
Why are you being so noisy?

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:17.780
Get up, get up! We're making the shower stall!

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:19.390
The shower stall?

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:21.850
I'm taking a day off.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:24.440
What are you saying?
It's everyone's shower, isn't it?

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:26.990
I said I'm taking a day off, so I'm taking a day off!

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:29.440
Honestly!

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:50.560
Howard!

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:54.210
Oh. What is it?

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:55.960
I guess you're finally awake.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.360
Want to help us make the tank?

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:00.490
Didn't I say today was my day off?

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:02.740
I worked three days' worth yesterday.

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:06.810
Honestly!

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:14.240
This is good.

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.020
You're openin' holes in the bamboo, right?

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:21.460
Finished.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:31.240
Fabulous!

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:41.050
It's ready, Luna. Try pulling it.

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:43.940
It's okay.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.040
Once we make the curtain, it's done!

00:15:58.540 --> 00:15:59.590
Howard!

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:11.580
Grab onto this.

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:21.640
I thought I was going to die.

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:25.040
Bell! You didn't fix it in place properly!

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:30.120
It's your fault I fell! Now bring my chair!

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:33.400
I can't help you right now!

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.690
What did you say? My chair comes first!

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:40.920
Everyone's busy working!
We'll worry about your chair afterwards!

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.250
What?

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:45.190
It's because you were slacking off
by yourself! Everyone, let's keep going.

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.170
I'll remember this!

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:03.010
The water's in!

00:17:25.860 --> 00:17:26.990
What are you doing?

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.820
Shut up, they'll hear you!

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:40.130
Howard...

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:41.610
Keep quiet.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.390
If you tell them, I'll deny it.

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:44.520
But...

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:46.750
Alright, it's finished!

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:48.630
Hey, try it out, quick!

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:49.410
Yeah!

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:52.840
You got that? Keep quiet and watch.

00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:56.330
Ready! I'm starting it.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:57.480
Don't!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.480
Don't turn it on, Luna!

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:01.860
Is something wrong, Bell?

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.540
Stop doing things like this!

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:07.490
Shut up! Hand that over!

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:24.980
Muddy water?

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:26.110
Why?

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:28.730
How did... this...

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:33.040
Bell! How dare you do this to me!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.710
Don't think this is over!

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:37.990
I'll tell my papa, and your dad'll be fired!

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:39.420
Our parents have nothing to do with it!

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.560
This is our problem!

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:44.090
Bell...

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:47.730
I think you'd better explain what happened here.

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:50.390
You planned to get Luna all muddy, didn't you?

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:53.130
No, you see, this is...

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:56.110
Howard, you really like to break things.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:59.330
It's the truth! Everything he does suits himself.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.060
He messes everything up!

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:02.630
I get it!

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:05.350
You all think it'd be better if I wasn't around!

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:08.430
Yeah, you all want me to leave, don't you?

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:09.740
Do what you want!

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:10.600
Howard!

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:13.240
Just let 'im go.

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:28.880
Well then, here I go...

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:32.630
We did it! It works!

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:35.130
We can use this.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:36.400
I'm done here too!

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:40.150
Wonderful!

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.590
You used the door from the emergency room!

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:47.260
I put a latch on it, so even if
the giant lizard comes, we'll be fine.

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:48.420
It's great!

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:50.310
It's finally finished!

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:53.010
It seems like we're finished for now.

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:55.210
I'll look for Howard.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:56.650
Hey, don't bother.

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:58.510
He'll come back when he's hungry.

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.310
It's good medicine once in a while.

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:03.830
Kaoru...

00:20:05.310 --> 00:20:06.660
Wow, it's fish!

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:07.920
Amazing!

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:09.270
So many of them!

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.380
They're big, too.

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.380
They seem like they'll take a while to cook.

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:15.380
You did really well to catch so many.

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:16.880
I built a trap.

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:19.450
I want to see what it's like!

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:21.720
Kaoru, you can make anything!

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:23.390
If we have leftovers, we can make dried fish.

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:25.040
Although it'd be better if we had salt.

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:27.040
Alright, we'll think of some way.

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:34.150
I'm so hungry...

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:36.310
Maybe I should go home after all.

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:37.770
No way, no way!

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.780
If I go back now I'll be the laughingstock.

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:42.510
And anyways, what's going on?

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.180
Hurry up and look for me!

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:47.030
Don't tell me they really mean
to leave me alone out here...

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:01.110
Papa!

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:05.690
Howard!

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:06.740
Bell?

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:10.110
What do you want at a time like this?

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:11.500
Let's go home.

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:14.010
Who'd go back to a place like that?

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:16.010
I'm going to live on my own!

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:17.110
Howard...

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.110
Everyone's worried.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:22.390
Really...

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:24.180
Well, I'm going home.

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:28.980
If you say so, I guess I have
no choice but to go back.

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:31.920
Hey, wait up!

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:37.320
They're back!

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:40.090
Hey!

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:43.810
Honestly, you're such a troublesome guy.

00:21:44.180 --> 00:21:47.820
What? I finally come back,
and you're talking like that?

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:51.700
Yeah, that's enough. Isn't it good
enough that he made it back safely?

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:55.240
Welcome home, Howard.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:58.040
I'm back.

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:07.810
Why do I have to wash that jerk's clothes?

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:12.960
I've washed and dried your clothes.
Are you wearing anything?

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:15.060
Yeah!

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:24.930
Luna and I made it.

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:26.910
The table's ready too.

00:22:27.310 --> 00:22:30.910
Everyone's here, so let's start the
Everyone's House completion party.

00:22:31.540 --> 00:22:32.670
Everyone's House?

00:22:33.060 --> 00:22:35.460
Yep. That's the name Sharla gave it.

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:39.080
Everyone's House...

00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:48.700
Cheers!

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:57.700
To celebrate making Everyone's House, we toasted for the first time since coming to this planet.

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:07.300
Even when nobody else can bring food home,
Kaoru alone manages to.

00:23:07.770 --> 00:23:09.490
He's a real reliable guy!

00:23:09.810 --> 00:23:10.840
You're great!

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:13.320
But the island is dangerous...

00:23:13.390 --> 00:23:15.490
...and I'd rather he didn't act on his own.

00:23:15.850 --> 00:23:16.560
That's true.

00:23:16.980 --> 00:23:19.430
Sometimes that Kaoru's too reckless.

00:23:19.810 --> 00:23:22.600
Please, don't make everyone worry!

00:23:25.470 --> 00:23:27.400
Next time: Not alone.
